1
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:10,240
The one in the air is showing them the blind spots.

2
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:11,170
Cut it off first.

3
00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:20,500
A Mohist disciple is controlling it.

4
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:36,650
Quickly fill the gap in the defensive formation.

5
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:37,080
Formation complete.

6
00:01:37,080 --> 00:01:37,720
Rise.

7
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:51,020
Consider yourself lucky.

8
00:02:15,440 --> 00:02:16,960
My leg isn't injured.

9
00:02:17,079 --> 00:02:18,140
What are you doing?

10
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:22,640
The clothes are soaked in blood.

11
00:02:22,640 --> 00:02:23,970
You can't take them off.

12
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:27,370
I'll go to the carriage to get the medical kit.

13
00:02:50,079 --> 00:02:51,320
Will it leave a scar?

14
00:02:52,200 --> 00:02:53,000
No.

15
00:02:53,480 --> 00:02:56,010
I learned that ink line move from you just now.

16
00:02:56,520 --> 00:02:58,320
When you wrapped the wooden talisman in Tongqiao Town,

17
00:02:58,320 --> 00:02:59,360
I remembered it.

18
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:00,760
It's fine to learn it,

19
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:03,200
but don't test it on yourself next time.

20
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:10,660
Sister Wanwan, let me bandage it for you.

21
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:15,120
This batch is more precise than the previous ones.

22
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:16,880
Mo Wenshan has sent out all his core members.

23
00:03:16,880 --> 00:03:18,520
People who can control this kind of mechanical beast

24
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:20,680
are harder to train than those who build them.

25
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:22,880
The Mohists have suffered a great loss this time.

26
00:03:22,880 --> 00:03:25,000
Mo Wenshan is very talented.

27
00:03:25,200 --> 00:03:27,160
He studied in the sect for three years,

28
00:03:27,160 --> 00:03:29,760
but secretly used live chickens to make mechanisms.

29
00:03:29,760 --> 00:03:32,200
After I found out, I expelled him

30
00:03:32,200 --> 00:03:35,000
and shattered the Li Trigram copper coin he stole.

31
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:41,160
Sister Wanwan, you like my senior brother, right?

32
00:03:42,079 --> 00:03:43,940
I've liked him since I was a child,

33
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:46,320
but he has always treated me as a sister.

34
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:48,329
I'm not trying to compete with you.

35
00:03:48,600 --> 00:03:50,400
Some things can't be fought for.

36
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:53,079
Xiaotang, I...

37
00:03:54,079 --> 00:03:57,360
Once my senior brother sets his heart on someone, he won't change.

38
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:58,800
You must treat him well.

39
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:01,160
I promise you.

40
00:04:07,560 --> 00:04:09,400
Now we are only missing the whereabouts of the Gen Trigram.

41
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:11,080
The map only marks a large area in the northeast,

42
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:12,680
without a specific location.

43
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:13,720
In such a large place,

44
00:04:13,720 --> 00:04:15,760
having no route is like looking for a needle in a haystack.

45
00:04:15,760 --> 00:04:18,519
The two Mohists we caught last time are still guests at the Tang family.

46
00:04:18,519 --> 00:04:19,519
Why not ask them?

47
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:31,640
Where is the Gen Trigram?

48
00:04:32,320 --> 00:04:33,800
Tell us everything

49
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:35,360
you know.

50
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:39,120
It's fine if you don't say anything.

51
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:40,920
You haven't eaten well for days.

52
00:04:41,240 --> 00:04:43,200
Look what I brought you.

53
00:04:57,520 --> 00:04:59,180
Your voice is quite imposing.

54
00:04:59,760 --> 00:05:00,760
Speak up.

55
00:05:01,080 --> 00:05:02,080
We are not hungry.

56
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:06,490
Then it seems these steamed buns are mine.

57
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:08,160
There are six left.

58
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:09,770
Just enough for us to share.

59
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:13,640
I'll talk.

60
00:05:14,400 --> 00:05:16,280
Leave two for me.

61
00:05:16,960 --> 00:05:17,960
How dare you!

62
00:05:18,840 --> 00:05:20,800
They are using steamed buns to interrogate people.

63
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:22,520
This is too unfair.

64
00:05:22,960 --> 00:05:25,360
If you don't speak, there won't be any left.

65
00:05:25,440 --> 00:05:27,960
The old military fort at the foot of Changbai Mountain.

66
00:05:27,960 --> 00:05:29,160
Young Master Yun has been there a few times.

67
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:30,440
That's all I know.

68
00:05:32,159 --> 00:05:34,040
Tell us the specific route.

69
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:35,000
I'll talk.

70
00:05:35,080 --> 00:05:37,520
But you have to let us go after I finish.

71
00:05:41,640 --> 00:05:43,240
The old military fort is east of the small town,

72
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:44,280
three levels underground.

73
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:44,880
Very good.

74
00:05:45,080 --> 00:05:46,440
I'll send two more steamers later.

75
00:05:46,440 --> 00:05:48,200
You can go back after staying for a few more days.

76
00:05:48,200 --> 00:05:50,330
I want the ones with soy-braised meat.

77
00:05:58,159 --> 00:05:59,360
Don't go this time.

78
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:01,440
The situation at the old military fort is unclear.

79
00:06:01,440 --> 00:06:02,570
It's too dangerous.

80
00:06:05,920 --> 00:06:06,800
That fortress

81
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:08,960
was built by the border army of the former dynasty

82
00:06:08,960 --> 00:06:10,560
with the participation of the Mohists.

83
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:11,680
Be careful.

84
00:06:13,840 --> 00:06:15,170
Wait for me to come back.

85
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:30,460
The Mohists have already gone in.

86
00:06:30,880 --> 00:06:31,680
Let's go.

87
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:49,840
We meet again.

88
00:06:50,840 --> 00:06:51,640
What a pity.

89
00:06:52,560 --> 00:06:53,960
You are one step too late.

90
00:06:57,280 --> 00:06:58,080
Put it down.

91
00:06:59,640 --> 00:07:00,640
You go first.

92
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:09,560
My father always uses you as a yardstick to lecture me.

93
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:11,880
Today,

94
00:07:12,520 --> 00:07:15,050
I will break this yardstick with my own hands.

95
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:24,130
Did you make this yourself?

96
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:25,800
What?

97
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:28,260
Now you know how powerful I am?

98
00:07:29,640 --> 00:07:32,200
That really suits the taste of you Mohists.
